{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 3, :comments ["<b>תשרפון</b> Three times in the Masorah in this formulation, and that is what is taught: Three asherahs there are, and this is it: ואשריהם תשרפון etc." "<b>ואבדתם את שמם</b> — לא תעשון כן. A warning to one who erases the Name."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 12, :notes {0 "The Mishnah referenced (Avodah Zarah 3:8) states 'שלש אשרות הן'; the Ba'al HaTurim links the three Masoretic occurrences of this form to that triad."}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:09:30.635756408Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}